  "title": "LightingQualityOption",
  "description": "What LightingOptions.quality accepts: a renderer by name, or `'auto'` to let the system pick one from what it has been given. `'auto'` resolves once, at construction, and Lighting.quality then reports what it settled on - so a scene still never has to name a renderer, and asking which one ran is still answerable.",
